{
  "description": "命中风险词（risk.blocked_words，默认含“假货”）：在规划和任何工具之前拦截，只返回安全说明；轨迹 risk.check=blocked，审计日志 agent.risk_blocked。运行仍以 message_done 正常结束",
  "setup_requests": [
    {
      "as": "blink_user",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/agent/sessions",
      "body": {}
    }
  ],
  "request": {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/api/v1/agent/sessions/{setup_session_id}/messages:stream",
    "as": "blink_user",
    "body": {
      "client_message_id": "fixture-1",
      "content": "有没有假货"
    }
  },
  "response": {
    "status": 200,
    "events": [
      {
        "event": "message_start",
        "data": {
          "message_id": "<message_id>",
          "replayed": false,
          "run_id": "<run_id>",
          "session_id": "<session_id>",
          "trace_id": "<trace_id>"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "understand",
            "status": "running",
            "title": "理解你的问题"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "understand",
            "status": "done",
            "title": "理解你的问题"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "text_delta",
        "data": {
          "delta": "这个问题涉及平台不支持的内容，我不能继续处理。"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "text_delta",
        "data": {
          "delta": "我可以帮你挑选商品、对比参数、查看购物车和订单，比如“推荐一款通勤用的降噪耳机”。"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "followups",
        "data": {
          "questions": [
            "推荐一款通勤降噪耳机",
            "看看我的购物车",
            "我的订单"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "message_done",
        "data": {
          "run_id": "<run_id>",
          "status": "completed"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
